Depends on / 依赖: FaithfulSMul, FaithfulSMul.algebraMap_injective, Function, Function.Injective, Injective, IsScalarTower, IsScalarTower.algebraMap_eq, algebraMap, algebraMap_eq, algebraMap_injective, injective, injective.comp
